  "description": "Provisioning library for MikroTik routers used on Octopark parking sites (RB960PGS hEX PoE + Huawei E3372 LTE modem). MNDP discovery (like Winbox, independent of IP addressing), RouterOS API client (TCP 8728/8729, IPv4 and IPv6 link-local), login scan across discovered devices, idempotent configuration packages: password, identity, WAN DHCP, LAN bridge + DHCP server (or the parking subnet on a shared site network over one cable), LTE backup uplink with automatic failover/failback (recursive routes), WireGuard VPN to a central hub with watchdog, firewall hardening and status reading.",
